<%- include('../partials/head') %>

<%- include('../partials/breadcrumbs') %>

<div class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Cookie policy</h1>
    <p class="meta-updated">Every cookie this site can set is listed below. There are no others.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>Required cookies</h2>
    <p>These are set because the site cannot work without them. They carry no advertising identifier.</p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Purpose</th><th scope="col">Lifetime</th><th scope="col">Set by</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>cart</code></td><td>Holds the item identifiers and quantities in your cart</td><td>14 days</td><td>This site</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>csrf</code></td><td>A random token that proves a form submission came from this site and not another one</td><td>4 hours</td><td>This site</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>cc</code></td><td>Records your answer to the cookie banner so it stops appearing</td><td>6 months</td><td>This site</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>agenotice</code></td><td>Records that you dismissed the eligibility notice</td><td>6 months</td><td>This site</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>lastref</code></td><td>Holds the reference number of the order you just submitted, so the confirmation page can show it to you. Signed so it cannot be edited</td><td>10 minutes</td><td>This site</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Optional measurement cookies</h2>
    <% if (analyticsConfigured) { %>
      <p>
        Audience measurement is configured for this site. It is loaded only after you press
        <q>Allow measurement cookies</q> in the banner. If you choose required cookies only, no measurement
        script is downloaded at all, so nothing is sent to the provider.
      </p>
    <% } else { %>
      <p>
        No measurement or analytics tool is installed on this site at the moment. The banner still asks,
        because if the shop turns one on later the answer you already gave is respected from the first page
        view rather than after the fact.
      </p>
    <% } %>

    <h2>Advertising and tracking</h2>
    <p>
      There are no advertising cookies, no social media pixels, no session recording and no fingerprinting
      scripts on this site. The content security policy served with every page blocks scripts from any origin
      other than this one, so a third party tag cannot be added by accident.
    </p>

    <h2>Changing your answer</h2>
    <p>
      Delete the <code>cc</code> cookie in your browser settings and the banner will ask again on your next
      visit. Blocking all cookies in your browser will stop the basket from remembering items and will stop
      forms from submitting, because the security token cannot be stored.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
